# Normalize every text file to LF — in the index and on checkout, on all OSes.
# This ends the recurring CRLF churn from Windows editors re-saving files
# (7 files kept reappearing as "modified" with only line-ending changes).
# The repo is pure Rust/TOML/Markdown/YAML; none of it wants CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
